  "description": "Like Fuji’s Team and Team\n\nIssue, the Professional is a racing bike. But it’s different. It’s\n\nelegant, less raw, less single-purpose. And lavishly equipped.\n\nReady? Easton Ultralite ProGram Taperwall alloy frame; Carbon fiber seat stays\n\nfor compliance; Campy Daytona 10-speed parts group; Spinergy wheels; integral\n\nCane Creek headset; Cinelli bar, stem and tape; Selle Italia seat, and a carbon\n\nfiber seat post. Lavish enough?\n\nThe Professional isn’t soft by any means, but it’s soft-ER. Big-miles\n\ncomfortable. And it’ll be rare, created in one smallish batch. Cool bike.",
